}a_{j_{n}}\cdots a_{j_{1}}\right)  \right\vert 1\leq j_{1}<\cdots<j_{m}%
\leq4,\right. \\
\left.  1\leq k_{1}<\cdots<k_{m}\leq4,0\leq m,n\leq4\right\} \\
=\mathbb{C}\text{-}\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \left.  \Phi
_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(  x_{j_{1}}\cdots x_{j_{m}}\right)  \right\vert
