{4}\Rightarrow\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathcal{H}_{\varphi_{f}}^{1}}\left\{
\Pi_{\varphi_{f}}\left(  I_{\mathcal{A}}\right)  \right\}  =4\\
\frac{1}{256}\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathcal{H}_{\operatorname*{tr}}^{1}}\left\{
\Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(  I_{\mathcal{A}}\right)  \right\}   &
=\frac{8}{256}=\frac{1}{8}\Rightarrow\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathcal{H}%
_{\operatorname*{tr}}^{1}}\left\{  \Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(
I_{\mathcal{A}}\right)  \right\}  =8
