_{\mathcal{H}_{\varphi_{f}}^{1}}\left\{  \Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(
a_{3}^{\dagger}a_{3}\right)  \right\}  =\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathcal{H}%
_{\operatorname*{tr}}^{1}}\left\{  \Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(  \frac{1}%
{2}I_{\mathcal{A}}+ix_{3}x_{11}\right)  \right\}  =4.
