\left(  \mathcal{H}^{1d}\ \right)  =\left[  \mathbb{C}\right]  \oplus\left[
\mathbb{C}\text{-}\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \left\vert \varphi_{1}^{{}%
}\right\rangle ,\left\vert \varphi_{2}^{{}}\right\rangle \ \right\}  \right]
\oplus\left[  \mathbb{C}\text{-}\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \left\vert
