{\textstyle\bigwedge\nolimits^{2}}
%EndExpansion
\left(  \mathcal{H}^{1}\oplus\mathcal{H}^{1d}\right) \\
=\mathbb{C}\text{-}\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \left(  \left\vert
