\varphi_{j_{1}}\cdots\varphi_{j_{n}}\right\vert }\left(  \mathcal{F}\right)
\end{equation}
each component has dimension $2^{r}.$

If we consider the GNS\ representation $\Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(
\mathcal{F}\right)  ,$ (which is reducible, in fact producing a $2^{2r}%
