}\left(  \mathcal{F}\right)  $ can be expressed as
\begin{align}
&  \sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}U^{\dagger}\sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}\left(
\begin{array}
[c]{ccc}%
\mathbb{I}_{r_{1}} & \mathbb{O} & \mathbb{O}\\
\mathbb{O} & -\mathbb{I}_{r_{2}} & \mathbb{O}\\
\mathbb{O} & \mathbb{O} & \mathbb{O}_{r-r_{1}-r_{2}}%
\end{array}
\right)  \sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}U\sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}\\
&  =\sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}U^{\dagger}\sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}\tau_{n}P_{n}%
U\sum_{0\leq n\leq2r}P_{n}\\
&  =\sum_{0\leq n,m,p\leq2r}\tau_{m}P_{n}U^{\dagger}P_{m}P_{m}UP_{p},
\end{align}
where
\begin{equation}
\tau_{n}\in\left\{  -1,0,1\right\}  ,
