\begin{equation}
\Pi_{\operatorname*{tr}}\left(  \widetilde{a}_{k}^{\dagger}\right)
=\sum_{0\leq m,n\leq2r}\sum_{1\leq j_{1}<\cdots<j_{n}\leq2r}\left\vert
